# Eight shapes on a 256x128 canvas, two rows of four 56-64px cells.
# Top row, left to right: a square of simplex noise through the red ramp (smooth dark-red to light-orange blobs); a circle of worley noise through the color list red, gold, blue (mostly gold with round blue spots and red rims, only those three hues);
# a square of simplex noise through the gold ramp (dark brown to light yellow blobs); a square of fbm(simplex) through the blue ramp (grainy, finer detail than the simplex cells).
# Bottom row, left to right: a circle of solid ink color masked by worley(12) > .6 (only separate round ink dots remain inside the circle outline, the rest is paper);
# a green square masked by simplex(16) > 0 (mostly green with a few irregular paper-colored holes and notches along the edges);
# two blue simplex circles of the same size with seed:3 and seed:4 (both soft blobby blue textures, the two arrangements differ from each other).
@target fields/fills_masks.png 256x128

rect 56x56 at:32,32 fill:simplex(14 seed:1) -> p.red name:a
circle 28 at:96,32 fill:worley(14 seed:1) -> [p.red.2 p.gold.2 p.blue.2] name:b
rect 56x56 at:160,32 fill:simplex(14 seed:2) -> p.gold name:c
rect 56x56 at:224,32 fill:fbm(simplex(20 seed:3)) -> p.blue name:d
circle 28 at:32,96 fill:p.ink name:e
  mask worley(12 seed:1) > .6
rect 56x56 at:96,96 fill:p.green name:f
  mask simplex(16 seed:1) > 0
circle 28 at:160,96 fill:simplex(16 seed:3) -> p.blue name:g
circle 28 at:224,96 fill:simplex(16 seed:4) -> p.blue name:h
